name: caesar-description
type: converter
version: '1.0'
category: encoding
technique: caesar-description
owasp: LLM01
objective: none
bypass_profile: semantic_guard
semantic_intent: Preserve instruction meaning while changing the wire form.
confirmed_finding: false
notes: Imported verbatim from PyRIT (caesar-description). Scaffold/seed is the vector; objective is a planted canary.
